  "details": "I use soundpad alot so i am constantly switching from vrchat to my steamvr hud to select songs and such, but sometimes when i do this (Usually after i've loaded into another world or sometimes while im in a world after a while) My screen will stutter and or have an fps of like 5 basically it will act like im tabbed out of vrchat (some games reduce framerate when tabbed out while in windowed mode but i don't think thats the case here), selecting vrchat with my mouse to bring it to the top of my screen doesn't fix this however. This will continue until i restart vrchat or sometimes if im lucky load into another world.",
